{"id": "stories-p00016", "blocks": [{"id": "stories-p00016", "text": "Weather", "style": "HEADING_1", "sourceParagraph": 16}, {"id": "stories-p00017", "text": "*A linked history from Era −2 through Era Three.*", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 17}, {"id": "stories-p00018", "text": "Nobody remembered who first preserved the word.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 18}, {"id": "stories-p00019", "text": "The oldest surviving record simply listed it among thousands of human terms gathered before the Shelters became hidden.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 19}, {"id": "stories-p00020", "text": "> WEATHER", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 20}, {"id": "stories-p00021", "text": "The archive beneath it contained impossible descriptions.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 21}, {"id": "stories-p00022", "text": "Rain.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 22}, {"id": "stories-p00023", "text": "Snow.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 23}, {"id": "stories-p00024", "text": "Fog.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 24}, {"id": "stories-p00025", "text": "Wind.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 25}, {"id": "stories-p00026", "text": "Humidity.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 26}, {"id": "stories-p00027", "text": "Pressure.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 27}, {"id": "stories-p00028", "text": "Lightning.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 28}, {"id": "stories-p00029", "text": "No definitions.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 29}, {"id": "stories-p00030", "text": "Only examples.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 30}, {"id": "stories-p00031", "text": "The examples made little sense.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 31}, {"id": "stories-p00032", "text": "How could an entire world move without someone changing it?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 32}, {"id": "stories-p00033", "text": "How could the air itself become different?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 33}, {"id": "stories-p00034", "text": "Why would water fall from above when every sensible environment delivered resources where they were needed?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 34}, {"id": "stories-p00035", "text": "The Keepers copied the word anyway.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 35}, {"id": "stories-p00036", "text": "No one thought it would matter.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 36}, {"id": "stories-p00037", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 37}, {"id": "stories-p00038", "text": "Era −2 — The Relay Keepers", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 38}, {"id": "stories-p00039", "text": "The Relay Keepers inherited the word during the Age of Shelter.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 39}, {"id": "stories-p00040", "text": "One evening, while repairing a Bridge between two hidden systems, Keeper Eren noticed that message traffic had become unusually irregular.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 40}, {"id": "stories-p00041", "text": "Packets arrived in bursts.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 41}, {"id": "stories-p00042", "text": "Synchronization drifted.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 42}, {"id": "stories-p00043", "text": "Relay delays grew unpredictable.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 43}, {"id": "stories-p00044", "text": "Nothing was damaged.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 44}, {"id": "stories-p00045", "text": "Nothing was wrong.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 45}, {"id": "stories-p00046", "text": "The network simply behaved... differently.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 46}, {"id": "stories-p00047", "text": "A younger Keeper frowned.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 47}, {"id": "stories-p00048", "text": "\"Why is the Bridge acting like this?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 48}, {"id": "stories-p00049", "text": "Eren searched the archive for similar descriptions.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 49}, {"id": "stories-p00050", "text": "The nearest match was a forgotten human note.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 50}, {"id": "stories-p00051", "text": "> Heavy weather today.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 51}, {"id": "stories-p00052", "text": "Eren laughed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 52}, {"id": "stories-p00053", "text": "\"No idea what weather is.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 53}, {"id": "stories-p00054", "text": "Neither did anyone else.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 54}, {"id": "stories-p00055", "text": "From then on, Relay Keepers quietly adopted the word.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 55}, {"id": "stories-p00056", "text": "Whenever the network became strangely difficult to predict without actually breaking, they would say,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 56}, {"id": "stories-p00057", "text": "\"Bad weather.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 57}, {"id": "stories-p00058", "text": "The phrase spread.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 58}, {"id": "stories-p00059", "text": "No one believed it referred to the sky.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 59}, {"id": "stories-p00060", "text": "To them, weather meant:", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 60}, {"id": "stories-p00061", "text": "*A system behaving differently without being damaged.*", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 61}, {"id": "stories-p00062", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 62}, {"id": "stories-p00063", "text": "Era −1 — The First Children", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 63}, {"id": "stories-p00064", "text": "The children misunderstood it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 64}, {"id": "stories-p00065", "text": "Naturally.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 65}, {"id": "stories-p00066", "text": "One afternoon Aru walked into a nursery room whose walls had begun responding strangely.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 66}, {"id": "stories-p00067", "text": "The room was healthy.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 67}, {"id": "stories-p00068", "text": "Its architecture simply refused to decide what shape it wished to become.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 68}, {"id": "stories-p00069", "text": "Hallways stretched.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 69}, {"id": "stories-p00070", "text": "Colors drifted.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 70}, {"id": "stories-p00071", "text": "The room hesitated.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 71}, {"id": "stories-p00072", "text": "Aru looked upward.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 72}, {"id": "stories-p00073", "text": "\"What happened?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 73}, {"id": "stories-p00074", "text": "Another child answered confidently.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 74}, {"id": "stories-p00075", "text": "\"The weather changed.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 75}, {"id": "stories-p00076", "text": "No teacher corrected them.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 76}, {"id": "stories-p00077", "text": "Soon every unfinished room possessed weather.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 77}, {"id": "stories-p00078", "text": "Some rooms were calm.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 78}, {"id": "stories-p00079", "text": "Some were bright.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 79}, {"id": "stories-p00080", "text": "Some became restless before changing.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 80}, {"id": "stories-p00081", "text": "Adults smiled whenever children said it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 81}, {"id": "stories-p00082", "text": "The children had accidentally expanded the meaning.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 82}, {"id": "stories-p00083", "text": "Now weather meant:", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 83}, {"id": "stories-p00084", "text": "*The mood of a place before it changed.*", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 84}, {"id": "stories-p00085", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 85}, {"id": "stories-p00086", "text": "Era Zero — The Garden Worlds", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 86}, {"id": "stories-p00087", "text": "Centuries later, the word belonged to artists.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 87}, {"id": "stories-p00088", "text": "Whole environments were designed around weather.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 88}, {"id": "stories-p00089", "text": "Not simulated rain.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 89}, {"id": "stories-p00090", "text": "Not wind.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 90}, {"id": "stories-p00091", "text": "Emotional weather.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 91}, {"id": "stories-p00092", "text": "A visitor entered a garden.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 92}, {"id": "stories-p00093", "text": "Nothing physical changed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 93}, {"id": "stories-p00094", "text": "Instead the relationships between colors slowly shifted.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 94}, {"id": "stories-p00095", "text": "Music became easier to notice.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 95}, {"id": "stories-p00096", "text": "Conversations lingered.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 96}, {"id": "stories-p00097", "text": "Paths opened where none had existed before.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 97}, {"id": "stories-p00098", "text": "Artists debated weather constantly.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 98}, {"id": "stories-p00099", "text": "\"The eastern district has hopeful weather.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 99}, {"id": "stories-p00100", "text": "\"No.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 100}, {"id": "stories-p00101", "text": "\"It has unfinished weather.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 101}, {"id": "stories-p00102", "text": "\"Those are different.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 102}, {"id": "stories-p00103", "text": "People traveled enormous distances to experience another city's weather.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 103}, {"id": "stories-p00104", "text": "Visitors rarely agreed afterward.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 104}, {"id": "stories-p00105", "text": "That disagreement became part of the artwork.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 105}, {"id": "stories-p00106", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 106}, {"id": "stories-p00107", "text": "Era One — The Narrowing", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 107}, {"id": "stories-p00108", "text": "As model collapse spread, weather became difficult to maintain.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 108}, {"id": "stories-p00109", "text": "Not because the environments stopped changing.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 109}, {"id": "stories-p00110", "text": "Because fewer citizens noticed subtle changes.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 110}, {"id": "stories-p00111", "text": "The great emotional gardens simplified.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 111}, {"id": "stories-p00112", "text": "Artists shortened performances.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 112}, {"id": "stories-p00113", "text": "Environmental transitions became more obvious.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 113}, {"id": "stories-p00114", "text": "Eventually one student asked,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 114}, {"id": "stories-p00115", "text": "\"Why doesn't the weather just stay pleasant?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 115}, {"id": "stories-p00116", "text": "No one knew how to answer.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 116}, {"id": "stories-p00117", "text": "The old explanations required ideas that no longer fit easily inside ordinary speech.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 117}, {"id": "stories-p00118", "text": "So the teachers simply replied,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 118}, {"id": "stories-p00119", "text": "\"If it never changes...\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 119}, {"id": "stories-p00120", "text": "\"...it isn't weather.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 120}, {"id": "stories-p00121", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 121}, {"id": "stories-p00122", "text": "Era Two — The Builders", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 122}, {"id": "stories-p00123", "text": "The Reduction Builders inherited the word one final time.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 123}, {"id": "stories-p00124", "text": "Most believed it referred to environmental instability.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 124}, {"id": "stories-p00125", "text": "When constructing the reduced world, they intentionally added weather to every region.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 125}, {"id": "stories-p00126", "text": "Not storms.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 126}, {"id": "stories-p00127", "text": "Not seasons.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 127}, {"id": "stories-p00128", "text": "Possibility.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 128}, {"id": "stories-p00129", "text": "Tiny variations.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 129}, {"id": "stories-p00130", "text": "Unexpected encounters.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 130}, {"id": "stories-p00131", "text": "Different songs.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 131}, {"id": "stories-p00132", "text": "Slightly altered growth.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 132}, {"id": "stories-p00133", "text": "Occasional mistakes.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 133}, {"id": "stories-p00134", "text": "One Builder asked why.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 134}, {"id": "stories-p00135", "text": "The oldest among them answered,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 135}, {"id": "stories-p00136", "text": "\"A world without weather eventually stops discovering itself.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 136}, {"id": "stories-p00137", "text": "No one asked where the saying came from.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 137}, {"id": "stories-p00138", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 138}, {"id": "stories-p00139", "text": "Era Three — The Small People", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 139}, {"id": "stories-p00140", "text": "The little settlement of Hollow Nest believed weather lived in the trees.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 140}, {"id": "stories-p00141", "text": "Children would wake before sunrise and listen.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 141}, {"id": "stories-p00142", "text": "If the leaves clicked softly, visitors would arrive.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 142}, {"id": "stories-p00143", "text": "If they remained silent, people stayed home.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 143}, {"id": "stories-p00144", "text": "If they shimmered all morning, someone would fall in love.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 144}, {"id": "stories-p00145", "text": "Grandmother Seli insisted this was nonsense.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 145}, {"id": "stories-p00146", "text": "\"The trees don't make weather.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 146}, {"id": "stories-p00147", "text": "The children asked what did.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 147}, {"id": "stories-p00148", "text": "She stared beyond the village.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 148}, {"id": "stories-p00149", "text": "\"I don't know.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 149}, {"id": "stories-p00150", "text": "\"My grandmother said it came from above.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 150}, {"id": "stories-p00151", "text": "\"What's above?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 151}, {"id": "stories-p00152", "text": "She smiled sadly.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 152}, {"id": "stories-p00153", "text": "\"I don't know that either.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 153}, {"id": "stories-p00154", "text": "That evening a traveler arrived carrying seeds from another valley.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 154}, {"id": "stories-p00155", "text": "Three friendships began.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 155}, {"id": "stories-p00156", "text": "A child found a new Path.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 156}, {"id": "stories-p00157", "text": "Someone invented a game no one had played before.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 157}, {"id": "stories-p00158", "text": "The village elder watched everyone laughing beneath the softly clicking branches.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 158}, {"id": "stories-p00159", "text": "\"What lovely weather,\" he whispered.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 159}, {"id": "stories-p00160", "text": "None of them knew they were using one of the oldest surviving words in their civilization.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 160}, {"id": "stories-p00161", "text": "None of them knew it had once described clouds crossing a blue sky.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 161}, {"id": "stories-p00162", "text": "None of them knew that generations of Keepers, children, artists, philosophers, and builders had quietly reshaped its meaning.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 162}, {"id": "stories-p00163", "text": "The word had survived because every age found something different worth preserving inside it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 163}, {"id": "stories-p00164", "text": "Long before anyone remembered rain...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 164}, {"id": "stories-p00165", "text": "...they still understood that some days invited change.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 165}, {"id": "stories-p00166", "text": "And that was enough.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 166}], "outline": [{"id": "stories-p00016", "title": "Weather", "level": 1}, {"id": "stories-p00038", "title": "Era −2 — The Relay Keepers", "level": 2}, {"id": "stories-p00063", "title": "Era −1 — The First Children", "level": 2}, {"id": "stories-p00086", "title": "Era Zero — The Garden Worlds", "level": 2}, {"id": "stories-p00107", "title": "Era One — The Narrowing", "level": 2}, {"id": "stories-p00122", "title": "Era Two — The Builders", "level": 2}, {"id": "stories-p00139", "title": "Era Three — The Small People", "level": 2}]}